<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.260
<i>Milady Kihel and Queen Dianna took a ride together on an airship.</i>

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:33.400
<i>I was glad that I would finally be able to return to Vicinity with them.</i>

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:39.360
<i>However, I was rather saddened to see just how distressed Milady Kihel was in front of her father's grave.</i>

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:48.960
<b>The Destruction of Nocis</b>

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.460
Milady Kihel...

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.370
Aunt Jessica told me that you'd be up here.

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:38.470
What are you doing here this early in the morning?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:42.250
I simply remembered that this was a very beautiful place.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:45.970
I too like the view here quite a bit.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.270
Whenever I see the sunrise...

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.770
...I can sense that this planet is full of life.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.270
Loran Cehack...

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:55.690
Do all of the people from the moon feel the same way about it?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.850
I certainly hope they do.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.240
You're right.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.030
Umm...Miss Kihel...

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.240
Shall we head back?

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:23.970
What is it?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.060
The sky, the wind, and the clouds...

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.430
I want everyone to be able to see and feel them as well.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.570
Even if our forces are prepared, there's no need to rush.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.150
The new Militia forces will become our trump card for turning the negotiations in our favor.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.860
But... the attack on our forces just a few days ago...

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.740
...destroyed many of our precious mechanical dolls...

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.540
...and quite a few people died.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:51.460
I should be able to turn that current situation to our advantage.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.830
Could you please pass that 9mm socket wrench over to me?

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.670
The military isn't just a trump card, it's filled with living beings.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.960
If things continue like this, the soldiers will begin to complain.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.550
I never said that they couldn't fight back...

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.960
...at the same time, I don't want our side to be the one that breaks the treaty.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:10.560
What in the world are you expecting from these negotiations, Sir?

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.850
I'd like to take advantage of anything I reasonably can.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.230
Advantage?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.060
Those guys have highly advanced technology.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.150
If they want to live here on earth...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.150
...I'm going to make them pay a price for it.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.360
And it'll be a rather high price as well.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.540
I'll be heading out, Milady Kihel.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.870
Wait a moment...your lunch!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.620
Thanks a lot, Ms. Jessica.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.550
I'll see you later, Milady.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.590
Keep yourself out of trouble.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.630
Where is Loran going?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.630
To the Mountain Cycle.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.050
He's heading off to assist Mr. Sid's next excavation project.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.460
I see.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:55.290
Milady, would you please help me bring your mother some tea?

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.850
That'd be fine.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:00.650
I'll ask some people to check out the parts.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.360
Go get the next one.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.440
Right.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.450
So that guy is part of the Moonrace.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.950
Seems like it.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.950
Is that okay?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.240
I don't really care. Sir Guin said not to mention him to the public.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.660
So that's why we're keeping quiet about him?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.920
Loran is doing a good job.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.340
But I could probably do just as well as him.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.040
In that case...

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.760
...Go and meet with the Militia's encampment by the Cellular river?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.670
Why do I have to go?

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.760
Colonel Michael said he needs a pilot.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.640
Apparently he just received a mechanical doll that came from the moon.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.970
That should be Loran's job!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.550
Joseph, are you still trying to make Loran out to be our enemy?

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.270
Since I know so much about machinery, I'll go.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.650
Looks like they uncovered another one.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.510
Keep a close eye on them day in and out.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.580
But, I heard that Sergeant Corin is on the move again!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:55.160
That bastard always likes to do whatever he wants without asking anyone.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.740
Report it to me if you find him.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.370
I love the sweat of a hard workout!

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.760
You seem to be getting used to the earth's environment.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.970
Indeed I am...but we're running out of time.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.960
We're out of time?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:17.640
Who's in charge of the Military forces around here?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:18.770
It should be Lieutenant Phil.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.140
That guy's a nobody!

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.940
What in the world are you saying!? We're currently in a cease-fire!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.950
That's why we have to seize this chance to kill them all!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.240
No!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:37.250
But I told you, the higher ups back home are preparing to send even more reinforcements. I'm a nobody compared to that force.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.750
What are you talking about?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.330
Her Majesty never gave out an order like that!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:46.670
And since she's been so damn slow, our home government has been preparing a new more aggressive strategy.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.130
Who would do that without permission!?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.840
It was probably Agrippa Maintainer.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.100
You can come down here and tell me about it.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.380
Hey, the stuff I said is public knowledge!

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:02.560
Quit fooling around! He's the one representing the Moderate faction!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.860
I don't care about that.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:07.650
If l don't do anything before the reinforcements arrives...

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.450
...I'll end up being a nobody!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.990
If this continues, the return operation will lag even further behind schedule.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.660
It appears that Guin Sard is trying to postpone the negotiations.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.460
He seems to want to keep us trapped here in Inglessa.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:24.170
Aggressive as it may seem, we should make our move for the Sunbelt, even if we must do it by force.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.050
You mean this Soleil should?

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.460
I mean all of our forces.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.760
We can continue the negotiations after that.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.380
How are we going to deal with our people still in Inglessa?

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.760
We've already taken control of the land.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.350
We'll leave a guard force behind for them, and once the negotiations are over...

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.180
...we'll relocate them towards the Sunbelt.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:42.940
I can see what you're saying, but are you serious about that?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.150
What do you think, Queen Dianna?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.570
If things continue like this, we're not going to make any progress.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.240
You're saying this ship should proceed toward the Sunbelt?

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.440
Yes.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.070
Are you sure about that?

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:01.370
We also must think of the safety of those who are here.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.540
That's true Your Majesty...but...

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.960
Ambassador Miran...

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.460
Would you like to try negotiating with Guin Rhineford once more?

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.020
I'll be sure to do that.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.050
Umm, Ambassador...

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:18.340
...When you do, I would like to take the opportunity to talk to that secretary Kihel Heim again.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:22.270
Understood. Allow me to set up the time for you then.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.840
Thank you.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.230
Eh? What's this thing?

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.250
The shield indicator has activated.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.670
Hey, Loran...

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.670
Yes?

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.330
Could you come check something out?

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.870
Sure.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:53.630
What do you think this is?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.050
I do not know.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.760
Even someone from the moon like you doesn't know what it is...

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:02.850
Mr. Sid, do you think that people from the earth and the moon will ever be able to live together peacefully?

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.940
You're already doing that.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.150
- That's true...
- But...

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.270
I don't really want a massive population to immigrate here.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.070
I suppose you're right.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:15.290
Milady Sochie also ended up slapping me because of that.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.700
That sounds about right.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.240
If we're going to be able to get along with the people from the moon...

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.990
...we'll need to obtain more mechanical dolls.

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:28.040
Although I wasn't able to obtain Guin Rhineford's approval...

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.250
The Militia army is still an independent force.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.670
Therefor, we'll be able to act on our own accord.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.130
Will the White Doll join us?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.840
There's no need. We should have enough power ourselves.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.850
We don't need someone from the Moonrace.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.390
Why don't you allow me to pilot it?

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.350
Can I, Colonel?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:48.060
Even the enemy knows that the White Doll is near Vicinity.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.360
We should be able to distract them because of that.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:56.280
You mean they won't expect us to attack them without the White Doll.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.570
Precisely.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.160
Our target is the main enemy ship, The Soleil.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.860
If we can't capture it, destroy it!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:15.050
Then, we'll let them decide the time of the negotiations.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.040
You can handle that.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:20.050
It seems that they're also requesting for Miss Kihel to visit the Soleil.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.140
Well, as long as they like her.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:26.050
You may contact Miss Kihel and ask her to return here from Vicinity.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:29.560
Sold it!? What do you mean you sold the FLAT?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.440
Just like I said, I sold it!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:34.650
We have chosen to live as people on the earth.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.940
We don't need that anymore.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.950
But there was no need for you to sell it!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.910
I wanted the money. Something wrong with that?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.870
Well, no...but...it's just that...

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:49.250
I need the money. If you want to blame me, go ahead.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.870
I suppose there's no reason for me to do that...

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:59.340
What's happening on the opposite side of the airport?

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.640
The Militia army is on the move to attack the Moonrace's territory.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.640
I'm going to head back to the Newspaper office.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.900
They've increased the attacks on our territory!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.820
6, no, 7 different places were attacked at the same time.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:22.110
Are they trying to surround the area?

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:26.410
Bruno, Jacop, let's go!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.500
I can't believe the Militia is breaking the truce!

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.790
The difference in power between our forces and theirs must be making them hysterical.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.130
The enemy Mobile Suit troops are approaching!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.840
The Militia's Mobile Suit forces wouldn't seriously be targeting the Soleil.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.300
Then, Lieutenant, Let us proceed to move the Soleil toward the Sunbelt.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.310
But, you haven't yet asked Queen Dianna!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:49.220
We'll be able to make her understand.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.890
- Request for the friendly troops to protect the Soleil.
 - Yessir!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.900
- Don't let our forces move out.
- Sir!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.320
Corin has already headed out, but he's just one individual.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.360
He's not even a squadron.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.700
Corin Nander, it looks like we won't be able to head out.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:10.700
Why not? They gave us an excuse, and now this is a good chance to destroy their city!

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.330
Aren't you going to try stopping him, Captain?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:18.300
No, we have our own responsibilities to attend to.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:22.120
Let Harry's team protect the Soleil.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.300
Attention please!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:32.390
The Phil Ackman team will now depart to stop the Militia's Mobile Suits, as well as attack the Mountain Cycle!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.890
If they're trying to surround us here...

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:39.900
Then we will take the fight to the Mountain Cycle and let them know that we don't intend to fight a war in the towns!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.030
I see.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.280
Since Corin isn't a part of our Mobile Suit forces.

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:57.000
What's going on here?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.330
Who approved the attack?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.090
Sir Guin, we've got to find some shelter!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.220
Shelter?

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:11.300
They're trying to attack the Castle that I had even given Dianna Counter the right to stay in?

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:13.810
Where is the Lieutenant currently at?

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.390
He's on his way.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.750
Is he...

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:20.520
That's...the Mechanical doll called a SUMO.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.400
No matter who it is, even if it's our enemy, don't let them kill anyone.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.110
Pass on this order.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.410
Yes Ma'am!

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:30.030
The air troops!

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:39.990
There are up to 2 or 3 people riding on those wooden planes. Don't shoot them, got it?

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:56.660
How reckless.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.730
You won't be able to defeat them with simple determination.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.020
Queen Dianna, please leave this place!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.530
Don't worry about me.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:09.530
If it has come to war, then I am responsible for being on the front and taking command of my people.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.320
Ready the Soleil to move out!

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:12.940
Right!

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:16.700
Queen Dianna...is this really what you wanted?

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.250
It's useless to simply shoot warning shots at them.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.920
We must attack them directly!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.130
I can't let you do that.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:26.920
If it is necessary, we will resort to close combat to stop them.

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.600
We'll show you...

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:34.600
...that we know how to use Mechanical Dolls as well!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.850
Joseph, go!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.430
Take a look at this!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.610
They brought a FLAT as well! This may be difficult.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.900
The third block's been damaged!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.960
Forget it! Just start up the Engine!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.330
I'll try!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.830
People really want to fight that badly?

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.030
Why?

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:00.460
That's the rocket from space...

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.830
Can that thing really fly!?

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.510
Your allies are out here!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.010
Lieutenant Phil, don't proceed too far ahead!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.590
They were the ones who broke the cease-fire!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.350
We have no choice but to drive off these barbarians by force!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.130
Go!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:27.900
Ambassador Miran, where are we going!?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.820
At this point, we can only head toward the Sunbelt.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.280
You can leave this to me.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.300
The Soleil is escaping!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.920
We won't be able to catch up with it once it reaches the sky.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.000
What should we do now?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.800
The enemy ship is flying!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.920
Now there's no way we can attack it.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.730
What can you do with just a plane?

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.370
Bostonia Castle's steeple has been destroyed!

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.480
I can't move any further, Sir Guin!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:33.420
Move it! I'm Guin Rhineford! Get out of the way!

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.250
Hold it!

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.930
Calm down! Don't be scared of the lights.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.580
Hey you, wait up!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.520
Please sell me this horse! I'll pay you double...

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.900
...No, 5 times the normal price!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.310
Are you an idiot?

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.610
What did you say!?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.820
I am the noble heir of Inglessa!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.530
Inglessa is finished!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.820
Your money's not worth the paper it's printed on!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.400
What!?

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:02.830
That can't be!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.210
Inglessa money is... worthless paper?

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:09.540
Listen to me...We've got to go, Keith!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.010
I painted this with the Militia colors.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.090
The enemy is behind you!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.260
I've got you now!

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:19.500
Too slow.

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.510
It's moving way too slow.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.600
Lieutenant Phil, don't cross the line!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.230
The Soleil already lifted off with two Almaiyas escorting it.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:33.190
I know. My troops will head to attack the Mountain Cycle and then will proceed to the Sunbelt.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.820
Upon looking down there...

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.610
Nocis seems to have been seriously damaged.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.700
Couldn't you have prevented this?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.910
Let the Royal Guards handle that situation.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.250
We're heading for the Mountain Cycle.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:50.420
The Gundam hasn't shown itself yet!?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:57.090
Back in the day, the Gundam used to have the courage to charge directly out and fight you!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.500
Gundam!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:06.230
Dianna Counter's flagship is flying southward.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.850
It appears to be undamaged.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.610
My eyesight is good enough so that I can see it from here.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:12.860
We can't do much if that thing can fly.

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:16.820
The Mechanical Doll troops fell back and are now requesting reinforcements.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:19.410
- Can we use the radio right now?
- Yes!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.870
Alright! Contact the troops at the Mountain Cycle.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:25.410
Ask them to send out the White Doll.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:28.250
You mean Laura's mustached mechanical doll, sir?

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:34.340
That's right. Dianna Counter won't be able to defeat the White Doll.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:37.220
Is this the White Doll's shield?

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.010
From the looks of its shape and size, I'd say that's right.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.680
Loran!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:46.600
This is bad. The Militia forces at Nocis are facing off against the moon's forces.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.520
Are you sure they're fighting with each other?

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.520
So Colonel Michael was serious about this.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:54.150
Are Sochie, Miashei and the rest of them there as well?

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.820
They're moving all over the place.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:59.320
So the White Doll has been ordered to head out.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.070
An order to head out?

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:05.340
Isn't it rather reckless for them to deploy the White Doll alone?

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:09.210
Their only choice is to send out their most valuable Mechanical Doll.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.420
Got it?

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:14.040
I'm heading off to investigate the new caves on the southern side.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:18.150
Loran, I must go back so I can complete my duty.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.800
Please take me back.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.010
You mean to your house?

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.800
I mean to the Soleil.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.800
Soleil?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.810
In order to negotiate in person.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:29.600
I wish to meet up with their commander, and well...

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:32.600
I have met with Dianna Soriel before, right?

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:36.320
So then I'll try directly negotiating with her.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.820
Stop the investigations of Mountain Cycle?

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:41.200
Yes. An order has been given to retreat.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.870
They say that Phil Ackman's troops will bombard this place soon.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.240
Are they joking!?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.700
This means I need to speak with with Lieutenant Phil directly!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.410
Get the car ready!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:52.530
Head toward the WaDom troops!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:03.090
Dianna Counter calls that Mobile Suit a WaDom, right?

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:05.710
R..Right.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.230
One Mobile Suit confirmed!

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:12.520
There's no need for us to approach the Mustached suit.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.400
We'll just destroy the whole Mountain.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:17.770
But, we still need to investigate the remnants of the Dark History that are there!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.690
Because of fools like you who keep saying that...

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:23.230
...those barbarians are able to dig up more Mobile Suits!

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.520
Something seems to be wrong with you, Lieutenant.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.910
What is it? You could've just told me over the radio.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:34.040
We've only recently began investigating this Mountain Cycle, sir!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.630
Are you saying the same stupid things as Poe?

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:40.380
It's because of that Mountain that the Militia army has obtained the strength to fight against us.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:44.680
But we may be able to find a Mobile Suit like the White Doll, sir!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:47.430
That thing is causing you to betray your common sense.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.100
Commence the attack!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:52.090
- Stay with him for now.
- Right!

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:02.190
Attention, all members of the excavation team...

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.070
Please hide underground!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.410
Dianna Counter is going to attack.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.410
Everyone, head underground, far to the west...

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:11.530
...wherever! Just get as far from here as you can.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:18.500
Milady Kihel... Are you hurt or feeling scared?

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.460
I'm doing fine. Can this mountain survive their attack?

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:22.920
I don't know.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:26.500
There's air here...so even when using their Mega Beam Cannon...

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.700
It's the Mountain Cycle!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.200
Is Phil even bothering to use any logical strategy?

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:54.120
Vicinity's nearby that place, correct?

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.330
Even someone like Phil wouldn't dare attack a small town.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:01.830
Mother...Jessica and Sam...

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:10.220
Thanks to those 3 units, most of Nocis is in ruins...

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:13.510
But they're not Mobile Suits from the official army.

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:19.800
You're kidding me! It's seriously not coming here...?

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:26.230
GUNDAM!

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.940
<i>Although we ended up in a strange tunnel leading into the Mountain Cycle...</i>

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:47.980
<i>I was happy to be alone together with Milady Kihel.</i>

00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:49.990
<i>However...</i>

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:54.030
<i>Corin Nander, who had been abandoned by Dianna Counter, attacked us.</i>

00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:57.190
<i>A battle in the inferno has now begun.</i>

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:01.030
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN-A GUNDAM...

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.420
<i>An Underground Corridor</i>

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:06.370
"The Lady calls to the wind."

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>An Underground Corridor</b>
